      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34: from about 19:00 to 23:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 23:09 I passed through the square; around 23:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:15 to 09:15 I was at the Dunmore house; around 09:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:24 I passed through the square; from about 11:30 to 23:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 23:11 I passed through the square; around 23:17 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 48665,
