      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34, from about 19:00 I was at home; at the Crooked Pike from about 19:15; at the Lind house from about 21:00; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 35 back at the Lind house from about 08:15; home around 09:30 and to bed; back at the Crooked Pike from about 17:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
