      "text": "On Day 34: from about 19:00 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:12 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 21:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 21:02 I passed through the square; from about 21:00 to 22:00 I was at the Lind house; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 22:06 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:16 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 09:15 I was at the Lind house; around 09:19 I passed through the square; from about 09:30 to 17:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:11 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:12 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 48665,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
