      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34, from about 19:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; along Mill Road around 22:30; home around 22:30 and to bed; on Day 35 along Mill Road around 16:15; at the square from about 16:15; home around 20:15 and to bed; on Day 36 along Mill Road around 07:15; at the mill from about 07:15.",
