      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34, from about 19:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; home around 23:15 and to bed; on Day 35 along Mill Road around 10:15; at the Dunmore house from about 10:30; along Mill Road around 11:15; home around 11:15 and to bed; back at the Crooked Pike from about 17:15; home around 23:15 and to bed.",
