      "key": "K0501",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34: from about 19:00 to 22:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:05 I passed through the square; around 22:11 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 48665,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "margaret",
       "nora"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0502",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Margaret and I have never got on \u2014 an unpaid bill from last winter.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:margaret"
      ]
     },
     {
