      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Crooked Pike, from about 19:00 to 23:00 on Day 34, I saw Agnes, Felix, Greta, Margaret, Marta, Ruth, Selma, Vera and Viktor, coming and going; Margaret was the worse for drink.",
