      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34, from about 19:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; along Mill Road around 22:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 48665,
