      ],
      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Crooked Pike, from about 18:00 to 22:30 on Day 34, I saw Agnes, Greta, Margaret, Marta, Selma, Vera and Viktor, coming and going; Margaret was the worse for drink.",
      "time": 48599,
      "topics": [
