      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34, from about 19:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; along Mill Road around 20:30; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; at the Vale house from about 20:30; along Mill Road around 21:00; back at the Crooked Pike from about 21:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 35 back at the Crooked Pike from about 16:15; home around 18:15 and to bed; on Day 36 at the square from about 07:15.",
      "time": 48665,
