      "key": "K0681",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34: from about 19:00 to 20:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 20:17 I passed through the square; around 20:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 20:30 to 21:00 I was at the Vale house; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 21:05 I passed through Mill Road; around 21:11 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:10 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 16:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 16:10 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 18:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 18:15 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; from about 07:15 to 07:15 I was at the square.",
      "time": 48665,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
