      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34, from about 19:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; at the Lind house from about 21:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 35 back at the Lind house from about 08:30; home around 09:15; at the Ash house from about 11:15; home around 12:15 and to bed; back at the Crooked Pike from about 20:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 36 at the square from about 07:15.",
      "time": 48665,
