      "in": "K0785",
      "key": "K0786",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 34: from about 19:00 to 21:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 21:14 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:00 I was at the Lind house; around 22:04 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:19 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the Lind house; around 09:15 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 11:00 I was at home; around 11:06 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 12:15 I was at the Ash house; around 12:14 I passed through the square; from about 12:15 to 20:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 20:12 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:17 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; from about 07:15 to 07:15 I was at the square.",
      "time": 48665,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
