      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Crooked Pike, from about 18:00 to 21:45 on Day 34, I saw Agnes, Felix, Greta, Margaret, Marta, Nora, Ruth, Selma and Vera, coming and going; Margaret was the worse for drink.",
